-- Pet tamers: their display pets stand on one spot, several stacked on top of each other.
--
-- Most pet tamers have their battle team spawned next to them (Julia Stevens 64330: Fangs 64334 and
-- Slither 64335, both at -9874.57, 98.49 in Goldshire). The spawns are static (MovementType 0) and
-- for 40 tamers two or three pets share the exact same position (104 spawns).
--
-- This lets every static display pet near a tamer wander within 2 yards of its spawn point
-- (MovementType 1 = random movement, spawndist 2), so stacked pets spread out and the group looks alive.
-- Covers 149 spawns of the team pets (battlepet_info NpcID of each species in the tamer's
-- battlepet_npc_team_member rows) within 30 yards of 53 tamers that have a "win a pet battle
-- against <tamer>" quest. Only spawns that are still static are changed.
--
-- Undo: UPDATE creature SET MovementType = 0, spawndist = 0 WHERE guid IN (<same list>);

UPDATE `creature` SET `MovementType` = 1, `spawndist` = 2
WHERE `MovementType` = 0 AND `guid` IN (
  1396577, 1396579, 1415345, 1426506, 1426507, 1426508, 1437557, 1437558, 1441897, 10647033,
  10647034, 10647035, 10647219, 10647220, 10647221, 10647402, 10647403, 10647533, 10647534, 10647600,
